      {
       "data": "Out[563]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{time for t1, t1' (s)} & 0.1485128\\\\\\hline\\text{frame map t1\\^{}Gc R == R t1\\^{}Lam (exact)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\text{max |t1' - finite difference|} & 1.26\\times 10^{-15}\\\\\\hline\\text{frame map t2 (exact)} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
