  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Generic point: SoV word bases, Gram matrix, measure (companion frame, exact)\n\nBra words <a1,k2,a3,k4| = <0| O^(1)_{a1} F2^{k2} O^(2)_{a3} F4^{k4}; ket words |y> = A1^{m1} K^(1)_{n2} A2^{m3} K^(2)_{n4} |0bar>. At generic theta: O^(p)_a = t_a(th_Ap - h), F = t1(th_Fp), A = t1(th_Ap), K^(p)_n = t_n(th_Fp + n h). The builders take the pair operators as arguments so that the same code is used with regularised operators at the ABJM point.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nmVac = nmProd4[UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4]];\nnmKet0 = nmProd4[UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 1], UnitVector[4, 4], UnitVector[4, 1]];\nnmIdx[w_] := FromDigits[w, 4] + 1;\nnmBar[j_] := nmIdx[3 - nmLabels[[j]]];\n(* ops association: \"F\" -> {F2,F4}, \"O\" -> {pair1: {O1,O2,O3}, pair2: {...}}, \"O23\" -> {special op for a=2,k=3 per pair}, \"A\" -> {A1,A3}, \"K\" -> {pair1: {K1,K2,K3}, pair2}  *)\nnmBraRow[ops_, {a1_, k2_, a3_, k4_}] := Module[{v = nmVac},\n  Do[Module[{a = {a1, a3}[[p]], k = {k2, k4}[[p]]}, If[a > 0, v = v . If[a == 2 && k == 3, ops[\"O23\"][[p]], ops[\"O\"][[p, a]]]]; Do[v = v . ops[\"F\"][[p]], {k}]], {p, 1, 2}]; v];\nnmKetCol[ops_, {m1_, n2_, m3_, n4_}] := Module[{v = nmKet0},\n  Do[Module[{m = {m1, m3}[[p]], n = {n2, n4}[[p]]}, If[n > 0, v = ops[\"K\"][[p, n]] . v]; Do[v = ops[\"A\"][[p]] . v, {m}]], {p, {2, 1}}]; v];\nnmGenericOps[G_, th_] := <|\"F\" -> {nmT[1, G, th[[2]], th], nmT[1, G, th[[4]], th]},\n   \"O\" -> {Table[nmT[a, G, th[[1]] - nmH, th], {a, 3}], Table[nmT[a, G, th[[3]] - nmH, th], {a, 3}]},\n   \"A\" -> {nmT[1, G, th[[1]], th], nmT[1, G, th[[3]], th]},\n   \"K\" -> {Table[nmT[n, G, th[[2]] + n nmH, th], {n, 3}], Table[nmT[n, G, th[[4]] + n nmH, th], {n, 3}]}|>;\nnmWithO23[ops_] := Append[ops, \"O23\" -> {ops[\"O\"][[1, 2]], ops[\"O\"][[2, 2]]}];\nnmGram[ops_] := Module[{W, Yk}, W = SparseArray[nmBraRow[ops, #] & /@ nmLabels]; Yk = SparseArray[Transpose[nmKetCol[ops, #] & /@ nmLabels]]; {W, Yk, SparseArray[Normal[W . Yk]]}];\nnmNZ[m_] := Count[Flatten[Normal[m]], Except[0]];\nnmGenT = AbsoluteTiming[nmOpsG = nmWithO23[nmGenericOps[nmGc[nmZ0], nmTh0]];][[1]];\nnmGenT2 = AbsoluteTiming[{nmWG, nmYkG, nmGramG} = nmGram[nmOpsG];][[1]];\nnmMG = Module[{Mn = ConstantArray[0, {256, 256}]}, Do[Module[{xs = Flatten[Position[Total /@ nmLabels, S]], ys}, ys = nmBar /@ xs; Mn[[ys, xs]] = Inverse[Normal[nmGramG[[xs, ys]]]]], {S, 0, 12}]; SparseArray[Mn]];\nGrid[{{\"time ops, words+Gram (s)\", {nmGenT, nmGenT2}}, {\"rank of bra words (exact)\", MatrixRank[Normal[nmWG]]}, {\"# nonzero Gram\", nmNZ[nmGramG]}, {\"Gram . M == 1 (exact)\", nmGramG . nmMG == nmId256}, {\"# nonzero M\", nmNZ[nmMG]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"152\" data-out-n=\"808\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"19\" data-sub-end=\"19\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[808]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.04em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.29em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">time ops, words+Gram (s)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank of bra words (exact)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># nonzero Gram</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstru