  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 3. Generic point: all 256 joint eigenstates (diagonal frame, 60 digits), right and left eigenvectors, eigenvalue data [hp]\n\nRight eigenvectors Psi_n (columns, diagonal frame, weight blocks) of the generic combination t1(3/11) + 7/10 tbar3(-5/7) - 3/13 tbar2(2/9) with twist Lambda = diag(z); left eigenvectors = rows of the inverse of the right-eigenvector matrix of each block. Companion frame: Psi_c = R Psi_Lambda, <PsiL_c| = <PsiL_Lambda| R^{-1}. tau_x (bra words) and tauT_y (ket words) are products of EIGENVALUES of the companion transfer matrices read off by the pivot ratio (op Psi)_p/Psi_p.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nmWeight[idx_] := Table[Count[idx[[{1, 3}]], i] - Count[idx[[{2, 4}]], i], {i, 4}];\nnmBlocks = Values[GroupBy[Range[256], nmWeight[nmComps[[#]]] &]];\nnmEigBlocks[comb_, prec_] := Flatten[Table[Module[{vals, vecs, VR, VL, cb = N[Normal[comb[[blk, blk]]], prec]}, {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[cb]; VR = Transpose[vecs]; VL = Inverse[VR];\n   Table[<|\"blk\" -> blk, \"val\" -> vals[[k]], \"r\" -> Normal[SparseArray[Thread[blk -> VR[[All, k]]], 256]], \"l\" -> Normal[SparseArray[Thread[blk -> VL[[k]]], 256]], \"w\" -> nmWeight[nmComps[[blk[[1]]]]]|>, {k, Length[blk]}]], {blk, nmBlocks}], 1];\nnmEvAll[op_, Psi_, piv_] := Module[{P = op . Psi}, Table[P[[piv[[n]], n]]/Psi[[piv[[n]], n]], {n, Length[piv]}]];\nnmGenStates[z_, th_, prec_] := Module[{Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z], comb, st, R, Ri, PsiD, PsiLD, PsiC, PsiLC, piv},\n  comb = nmTbar[1, Lam, 3/11, th] + 7/10 nmTbar[3, Lam, -5/7, th] - 3/13 nmTbar[2, Lam, 2/9, th];\n  st = nmEigBlocks[comb, prec]; R = N[nmRmat[z], prec]; Ri = N[Inverse[nmRmat[z]], prec];\n  PsiD = Transpose[st[[All, \"r\"]]]; PsiLD = st[[All, \"l\"]];\n  PsiC = R . PsiD; PsiLC = PsiLD . Ri; piv = Table[Ordering[Abs[PsiC[[All, n]]], -1][[1]], {n, 256}];\n  <|\"st\" -> st, \"PsiD\" -> PsiD, \"PsiLD\" -> PsiLD, \"PsiC\" -> PsiC, \"PsiLC\" -> PsiLC, \"piv\" -> piv, \"w\" -> st[[All, \"w\"]]|>];\nnmGenTau[S_, ops_, prec_] := Module[{Psi = S[\"PsiC\"], piv = S[\"piv\"], ev, tauO1, tauO2, tauF, tauA, tauK, tauX, tauY},\n  ev[op_] := nmEvAll[N[op, prec], Psi, piv];\n  tauF = {ev[ops[\"F\"][[1]]], ev[ops[\"F\"][[2]]]};\n  tauO1 = Prepend[Table[ev[ops[\"O\"][[1, a]]], {a, 3}], ConstantArray[1, 256]];\n  tauO2 = Prepend[Table[ev[ops[\"O\"][[2, a]]], {a, 3}], ConstantArray[1, 256]];\n  tauA = {ev[ops[\"A\"][[1]]], ev[ops[\"A\"][[2]]]};\n  tauK = {Prepend[Table[ev[ops[\"K\"][[1, n]]], {n, 3}], ConstantArray[1, 256]], Prepend[Table[ev[ops[\"K\"][[2, n]]], {n, 3}], ConstantArray[1, 256]]};\n  tauX = Table[tauO1[[x[[1]] + 1]] tauF[[1]]^x[[2]] tauO2[[x[[3]] + 1]] tauF[[2]]^x[[4]], {x, nmLabels}];\n  tauY = Table[tauA[[1]]^y[[1]] tauK[[1, y[[2]] + 1]] tauA[[2]]^y[[3]] tauK[[2, y[[4]] + 1]], {y, nmLabels}];\n  <|\"tauX\" -> tauX, \"tauY\" -> tauY, \"tauF\" -> tauF, \"tauA\" -> tauA|>];\nnmGenS = Module[{t}, t = AbsoluteTiming[nmSG = nmGenStates[nmZ0, nmTh0, 60]][[1]]; t];\nGrid[{{\"time (s)\", nmGenS}, {\"# states\", Length[nmSG[\"st\"]]}, {\"min eigenvalue gap of the combination\", N[Min[Abs[Subtract @@@ Subsets[nmSG[\"st\"][[All, \"val\"]], {2}]]], 5]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"153\" data-out-n=\"816\" data-sub-idx=\"7\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"22\" data-sub-end=\"22\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[816]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"XGJlZ2lue2FycmF5fXt8Y3xjfH1caGxpbmVcdGV4dHt0aW1lIChzKX0gJiAyMi4yMTI5NjExXFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHtcIyBzdGF0ZXN9ICYgMjU2XFxcaGxpbmVcdGV4dHttaW4gZWlnZW52YWx1ZSBnYXAgb2YgdGhlIGNvbWJpbmF0aW9ufSAmIDAuMDAwMDIxNTAzXFxcaGxpbmVcZW5ke2FycmF5fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">time (s)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># states</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min eigenvalue gap of the combination</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">22.2129611</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.000021503</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[816]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{time (s)} & 22.2129611\\\\\\hline\\text{\\# states} & 256\\\\\\hline\\text{min eigenvalue gap of the combination} & 0.000021503\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "23a8934b-92e9-476a-abd5-396e26b301fb"
    }
