  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Task 1: relation between ||Psi||^2 = Psi^dagger Psi and <PsiL|Psi> at finite real twist\n\nExact algebraic identity (weight counting, no numerics): |0>_Lambda := R^{-1}|0bar>_c = (1,1,1,1) (x) lambda (x) (1,1,1,1) (x) lambda, <0|_Lambda = <0|_c R = lambda (x) 1 (x) lambda (x) 1, so on any state of weight w: <0|Psi> = lambda^w <0bar^T|Psi>, lambda^w = prod_j lambda_j^{w_j}, lambda_j = 1/prod_{m != j}(z_j - z_m). Hence if the left eigenvector were PsiL = c Psi^T (diagonal frame) one would have exactly |<0|Psi>|^2 = lambda^w N ||Psi||^2. Test below whether that holds at finite real twist and what replaces it.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nmLamW[z_] := Table[1/Product[If[m == j, 1, z[[j]] - z[[m]]], {m, 4}], {j, 4}];\nnmRz = nmRmat[nmZ0]; nmRzi = Inverse[nmRz];\nnmLamZ = nmLamW[nmZ0];\nnmId1 = {nmVac . nmRz == nmProd4[nmLamZ, {1, 1, 1, 1}, nmLamZ, {1, 1, 1, 1}], nmRzi . nmKet0 == nmProd4[{1, 1, 1, 1}, nmLamZ, {1, 1, 1, 1}, nmLamZ]};\nnmKet0D = nmProd4[{1, 1, 1, 1}, nmLamZ, {1, 1, 1, 1}, nmLamZ]; nmBra0D = nmProd4[nmLamZ, {1, 1, 1, 1}, nmLamZ, {1, 1, 1, 1}];\nnmWts = nmSG[\"w\"]; nmLw = Table[Times @@ (nmLamZ^nmWts[[n]]), {n, 256}];\nnmOv0D = nmBra0D . nmPsiD; nmOv0bT = nmKet0D . nmPsiD;\nnmLamWid = Max[Abs[nmOv0D - nmLw nmOv0bT]/Max[Abs[nmOv0D]]];\n(* orthogonality of the right eigenvectors (diagonal frame): Psi_n^T Psi_m, and Hermitian pairing Psi_n^dagger Psi_m *)\nnmGT = Transpose[nmPsiD] . nmPsiD; nmGH = ConjugateTranspose[nmPsiD] . nmPsiD;\nnmOffRel[G_] := Max[Table[If[n == m, 0, Abs[G[[n, m]]]/Sqrt[Abs[G[[n, n]] G[[m, m]]]]], {n, 256}, {m, 256}]];\n(* cosine between PsiL_n and Psi_n^T, and between PsiL_n and Psi_n^dagger *)\nnmCosT = Table[Abs[nmPsiLD[[n]] . nmPsiD[[All, n]]]/(Norm[nmPsiLD[[n]]] Norm[nmPsiD[[All, n]]]), {n, 256}];\nnmCosT2 = Table[Abs[nmPsiLD[[n]] . Conjugate[nmPsiD[[All, n]]]]/(Norm[nmPsiLD[[n]]] Norm[nmPsiD[[All, n]]]), {n, 256}];\nnmRealQ = Table[Max[Abs[Im[nmPsiD[[All, n]]/nmPsiD[[Ordering[Abs[nmPsiD[[All, n]]], -1][[1]], n]]]]] < 10^-40, {n, 256}];\nGrid[{{\"identities <0|_Lam = lam(x)1(x)lam(x)1 and |0bar>_Lam = 1(x)lam(x)1(x)lam (exact)\", nmId1}, {\"<0|Psi> = lambda^w <0bar^T|Psi>: max rel. deviation over 256 states\", N[nmLamWid, 3]}, {\"# states with real eigenvector / complex\", {Count[nmRealQ, True], Count[nmRealQ, False]}}, {\"max off-diagonal cosine of the right eigenvectors, Psi^T Psi (bilinear)\", N[nmOffRel[nmGT], 4]}, {\"same, Hermitian Psi^dag Psi\", N[nmOffRel[nmGH], 4]}, {\"min over states of cos(PsiL_n, Psi_n^T) (1 means PsiL = c Psi^T)\", N[Min[nmCosT], 4]}, {\"min over states of cos(PsiL_n, Psi_n^dagger)\", N[Min[nmCosT2], 4]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"155\" data-out-n=\"838\" data-sub-idx=\"15\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"10\" data-sub-start=\"15\" data-sub-end=\"15\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[838]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:8.44em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.49em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:6.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">identities &lt;0|_Lam = lam(x)1(x)lam(x)1 and |0bar&gt;_Lam = 1(x)lam(x)1(x)lam (exact)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&lt;0|Psi&gt; = lambda</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">w &lt;0bar</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T|Psi&gt;: max rel. deviation over 256 states</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"># states with real eigenvector / complex</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">max off-diagonal cosine of the right eigenvectors, Psi</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T Psi (bilinear)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">same, Hermitian Psi</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">dag Psi</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min over states of cos(PsiL_n, Psi_n</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T) (1 means PsiL = c Psi</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">T)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:0.59em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">min over states of cos(PsiL_n, Psi_n</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">dagger)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:8.4em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.95em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">