  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result of the generic-point tests.** The identity <0|Psi> = lambda^w <0bar^T|Psi> holds exactly. At finite generic twist the right eigenvectors are NOT orthogonal and PsiL is not proportional to Psi^T or Psi^dagger. The numbers that matter are the invariants H_n := |<0|Psi>|^2 / (|lambda^w N| ||Psi||^2) = |<0|Psi>| |<PsiL|Psi>| / (|lambda^w| |<PsiL|0bar>| ||Psi||^2) (diagonal frame, zero weight so lambda^w = 1). On the pair-by-pair ABJM epsilon-chain z = 1 + eps phi, theta_F = eps theta0 we measure H_n - 1 vs eps on the 28 zero-weight states (diagonal frame only; 90 digits).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nmPhi = {9/10, 7/20, 3/5, -11/10}; nmThdir = {0, 37/100};\nnmThEps[eps_] := Module[{tf = eps nmThdir}, {tf[[1]] + 2 nmH, tf[[1]], tf[[2]] + 2 nmH, tf[[2]]}];\nnmZero = Select[Range[256], nmWeight[nmComps[[#]]] == {0, 0, 0, 0} &];\n(* zero-weight block of the generic combination (with polynomial prefactors) in the diagonal frame, 90 digits *)\nnmZeroStates[eps_, prec_] := Module[{z = 1 + eps nmPhi, th = nmThEps[eps], Lam, comb, cb, vals, vecs, VR, VL},\n  Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z];\n  comb = nmTbar[1, Lam, 3/11, th] + 7/10 nmPre[3, -5/7, th] nmTbar[3, Lam, -5/7, th] - 3/13 nmPre[2, 2/9, th] nmTbar[2, Lam, 2/9, th];\n  cb = N[Normal[comb[[nmZero, nmZero]]], prec]; {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[cb]; VR = Transpose[vecs]; VL = Inverse[VR];\n  <|\"z\" -> z, \"th\" -> th, \"vals\" -> vals, \"R\" -> VR, \"L\" -> VL|>];\nnmHtest[S_] := Module[{lam = nmLamW[S[\"z\"]], bra0, ket0, rows},\n  bra0 = nmProd4[lam, {1, 1, 1, 1}, lam, {1, 1, 1, 1}][[nmZero]]; ket0 = nmProd4[{1, 1, 1, 1}, lam, {1, 1, 1, 1}, lam][[nmZero]];\n  Table[Module[{psi = S[\"R\"][[All, n]], psiL = S[\"L\"][[n]], ov0, ovL, pr, nrm, N0, Hn, realQ},\n    ov0 = bra0 . psi; ovL = psiL . ket0; pr = psiL . psi; nrm = Conjugate[psi] . psi; N0 = ov0 ovL/pr;\n    realQ = Max[Abs[Im[psi/psi[[Ordering[Abs[psi], -1][[1]]]]]]] < 10^-30;\n    {n, realQ, Abs[ov0]^2/(Abs[N0] nrm), Abs[ov0]/Sqrt[nrm], Abs[psiL . Conjugate[psi]]/(Norm[psiL] Norm[psi])}], {n, 28}]];\nnmHeps = Table[Module[{S = nmZeroStates[e, 90], r}, r = nmHtest[S]; {e, r}], {e, {1/10, 1/20, 1/50, 1/100, 1/200, 1/400}}];\nGrid[Prepend[Table[{e[[1]], Count[e[[2, All, 2]], True], N[Max[Abs[Select[e[[2]], #[[2]] &][[All, 3]] - 1]], 4], N[Max[Abs[Select[e[[2]], #[[2]] &][[All, 3]] - 1]]/(2 e[[1]]), 4], N[Min[Select[e[[2]], #[[2]] &][[All, 5]]], 6]}, {e, nmHeps}], {\"eps\", \"# real states (of 28)\", \"max |H_n - 1| (real states)\", \"max|H-1|/(2 eps)\", \"min cos(PsiL, Psi^*) (real states)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
