  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result [hp 90 digits].** On the real-eigenvalue states of the zero-weight block H_n - 1 = O(eps) (max about 3.8 eps), cos(PsiL, Psi^*) = 1 - O(eps^2); 12 of the 28 states have complex eigenvalues at finite twist. At the generic point (z = (3/2,5/4,2/3,4/7)) PsiL is not proportional to Psi^T (cos between 0.37 and 1) nor is the companion-frame (R Psi)^T a left eigenvector (cos <= 0.06), and no fixed diagonal operator S gives PsiL = Psi^T S. So at finite twist ||Psi||^2 is not the SoV pairing; the exact statement is |<0|Psi>|^2 = H lambda^w N ||Psi||^2 with H = <Psi^T 0bar><PsiL Psi>/(<PsiL 0bar> Psi^T Psi) = 1 + O(eps); the Q-based quantity is <0|Psi>^2/<PsiL_*|Psi> = lambda^w/(sum tauT M tau) with PsiL_* the left eigenvector normalised by <PsiL_*|0bar> = <0bar^T|Psi>.\n\n## 6. ABJM point (pair-by-pair theta): regularised bra and ket bases, exact\n\ntheta = (thF1 + 2h, thF1, thF2 + 2h, thF2), u0_p = thF_p + h = thA_p - h. Bra operators per pair: F = t1(thF), O_1 = t1(u0), O_2 = W = t2'(u0) - t1'(u0) t1(thF), O_3 = Z = t3'(u0), O23 = t2(u0) (used for the word with a = 2, k = 3). Ket operators: A = t1(thA), K_1 = t1(u0), K_2 = Wt = t2'(thA) - t1(thA) t1'(u0), K_3 = Zt = t3'(thA + h). Identities used (checked exactly below): t3(u0) = 0, t2(u0) = t1(u0) t1(thF), t2(thA) = t1(thA) t1(u0), t3(thA + h) = 0.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nmAbjmOps[G_, th_] := Module[{u0 = {th[[2]], th[[4]]} + nmH, thA = {th[[1]], th[[3]]}, thF = {th[[2]], th[[4]]}, out = <||>, res = <||>},\n  Do[Module[{F, t1u, d1u, t2u, d2u, t3u, d3u, tA, t2A, d2A, t3A, d3A},\n    F = nmT[1, G, thF[[p]], th]; {t1u, d1u} = nmTD[1, G, u0[[p]], th]; {t2u, d2u} = nmTD[2, G, u0[[p]], th]; {t3u, d3u} = nmTD[3, G, u0[[p]], th];\n    tA = nmT[1, G, thA[[p]], th]; {t2A, d2A} = nmTD[2, G, thA[[p]], th]; {t3A, d3A} = nmTD[3, G, thA[[p]] + nmH, th];\n    res[p] = {nmZeroQ[t3u], nmZeroQ[t2u - t1u . F], nmZeroQ[t2A - tA . t1u], nmZeroQ[t3A]};\n    out[p] = <|\"F\" -> F, \"A\" -> tA, \"O\" -> {t1u, d2u - d1u . F, d3u}, \"O23\" -> t2u, \"K\" -> {t1u, d2A - tA . d1u, d3A},\n       \"d1u\" -> d1u, \"d2u\" -> d2u, \"d3u\" -> d3u, \"t2u\" -> t2u, \"t2A\" -> t2A, \"d2A\" -> d2A, \"d3A\" -> d3A|>], {p, 2}];\n  <|\"F\" -> {out[1][\"F\"], out[2][\"F\"]}, \"A\" -> {out[1][\"A\"], out[2][\"A\"]}, \"O\" -> {out[1][\"O\"], out[2][\"O\"]}, \"O23\" -> {out[1][\"O23\"], out[2][\"O23\"]}, \"K\" -> {out[1][\"K\"], out[2][\"K\"]}, \"pair\" -> {out[1], out[2]}, \"ident\" -> {res[1], res[2]}|>];\nnmAbjmTest = Module[{eps = 1/100, z, th, G}, z = 1 + eps nmPhi; th = nmThEps[eps]; G = nmGc[z];\n  {AbsoluteTiming[nmOpsA = nmAbjmOps[G, th]][[1]], nmOpsA[\"ident\"], MemoryInUse[]/10.^9}];\nGrid[{{\"time (s), memory (GB)\", {nmAbjmTest[[1]], nmAbjmTest[[3]]}}, {\"exact identities per pair: t3(u0)=0, t2(u0)=t1(u0)t1(thF), t2(thA)=t1(thA)t1(u0), t3(thA+h)=0 (eps = 1/100)\", nmAbjmTest[[2]]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"725116\" data-output-id=\"157\" data-out-n=\"848\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"14\" data-sub-start=\"10\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[848]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.64em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:3.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.66em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">time (s), memory (GB)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.45em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">exact identities per pair: t3(u0)=0, t2(u0)=t1(u0)t1(thF), t2(thA)=t1(thA)t1(u0), t3(thA+h)=0 (eps = 1/100)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span><