      {
       "data": "Out[848]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{time (s), memory (GB)} & \\left\\{36.6733809,5.613475080000001\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\text{exact identities per pair: t3(u0)=0, t2(u0)=t1(u0)t1(thF), t2(thA)=t1(thA)t1(u0), t3(thA+h)=0 (eps = 1/100)} & \\begin{pmatrix}\\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\\\\\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True} & \\mathrm{True}\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
