  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. ABJM point, eps-chain: Gram matrix, measure, eigenvalue data, 1/N = sum tauT M tau vs direct, and the Q-based even bridge\n\nz = 1 + eps phi, phi = (9/10, 7/20, 3/5, -11/10), theta_F = eps (0, 37/100), c = 3/10, kappa = 1 - c eps, a = (phi1 - c)/(phi1 - phi4); h = 1/2. All wave functions tau_x, tauT_y are products of eigenvalues of the commuting companion operators (F, A, O_a, O23, K_n above) read off from the joint eigenvectors; the same eigenvalue data enter K_kappa and the closed form of <W_a|Psi>. The direct quantities <0|Psi>, <PsiL|0bar>, <PsiL|Psi> are used only as a check.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nmPab[nu_, h_][r2_, r4_] := {{(nu/(nu + h))^2 r2^2 r4^2, nu/(nu + h) r2^2 r4, (nu - h)/nu r2^2 + h/(nu + h) r2 r4}, {nu/(nu + h) r2 r4^2 - h/(nu + h) r2^2 r4, nu/(nu + h) r2 r4, r2}, {r4^2 - (h/nu) (1 + h/(nu + h)) r2 r4 - (h/nu) (nu - h)/nu r2^2, r4 - (h/nu) r2, 1}};\nnmLamK[k_, u_, th_] := Times @@ DeleteCases[Join[Table[u - th[[3]] - j nmH, {j, 0, k - 1}], {u - th[[4]] - k nmH}, Table[u - th[[4]] - j nmH, {j, 0, k - 2}]], 0];\nnmAbjmEval[eps_, prec_, ops_, Gm_, cpar_] := Module[{S, z, th, lam, R, Ri, PsiD, PsiLD, PsiC, PsiLC, piv, ev, Fv, Av, Ov, O23v, Kv, d1v, d2v, d3v, wchk, tauX, tauY, Gs, sol, invNQ, ov0, ovL0, pr, invNdir, h = nmH, bra0D, aa, kap, kap0, y, s, Nk, l1, l2, l3, nu, ut, nrm, u0, Kk, rows, bra0W, psis, res, gerr},\n  S = nmZeroStates[eps, prec]; z = S[\"z\"]; th = S[\"th\"];\n  R = N[nmRmat[z], prec]; Ri = N[Inverse[nmRmat[z]], prec];\n  PsiD = ConstantArray[0, {256, 28}]; PsiD[[nmZero]] = S[\"R\"]; PsiLD = ConstantArray[0, {28, 256}]; PsiLD[[All, nmZero]] = S[\"L\"];\n  PsiC = R . PsiD; PsiLC = PsiLD . Ri; piv = Table[Ordering[Abs[PsiC[[All, n]]], -1][[1]], {n, 28}];\n  ev[op_] := nmEvAll[N[op, prec], PsiC, piv];\n  Fv = ev /@ ops[\"F\"]; Av = ev /@ ops[\"A\"]; Ov = Table[ev /@ ops[\"O\"][[p]], {p, 2}]; O23v = ev /@ ops[\"O23\"]; Kv = Table[ev /@ ops[\"K\"][[p]], {p, 2}];\n  d1v = ev /@ Table[ops[\"pair\"][[p, \"d1u\"]], {p, 2}]; d2v = ev /@ Table[ops[\"pair\"][[p, \"d2u\"]], {p, 2}]; d3v = ev /@ Table[ops[\"pair\"][[p, \"d3u\"]], {p, 2}];\n  wchk = Max[Abs[Table[(d2v[[p]] - d1v[[p]] Fv[[p]])/Ov[[p, 2]] - 1, {p, 2}]], Abs[Table[d3v[[p]]/Ov[[p, 3]] - 1, {p, 2}]]];\n  tauX = Table[Module[{f = {1, 1}}, Do[Module[{a = {x[[1]], x[[3]]}[[p]], k = {x[[2]], x[[4]]}[[p]]}, f[[p]] = If[a == 0, 1, If[a == 2 && k == 3, O23v[[p]], Ov[[p, a]]]] Fv[[p]]^k], {p, 2}]; f[[1]] f[[2]]], {x, nmLabels}];\n  tauY = Table[Module[{f = {1, 1}}, Do[Module[{m = {y[[1]], y[[3]]}[[p]], n = {y[[2]], y[[4]]}[[p]]}, f[[p]] = Av[[p]]^m If[n == 0, 1, Kv[[p, n]]]], {p, 2}]; f[[1]] f[[2]]], {y, nmLabels}];\n  Gs = SparseArray[N[Gm, prec + 80]]; sol = LinearSolve[Gs, N[tauX, prec + 20]];\n  invNQ = Table[tauY[[All, n]] . sol[[All, n]], {n, 28}];\n  ov0 = nmVac . PsiC; ovL0 = PsiLC . nmKet0; pr = Table[PsiLC[[n]] . PsiC[[All, n]], {n, 28}]; invNdir = pr/(ov0 ovL0);\n  gerr = Max[Abs[Gs . sol - N[tauX, prec + 20]]];\n  (* closed-form even bridge *)\n  lam = nmLamW[z]; bra0D = nmProd4[lam, {1, 1, 1, 1}, lam, {1, 1, 1, 1}];\n  aa = (nmPhi[[1]] - cpar)/(nmPhi[[1]] - nmPhi[[4]]); kap = 1 - cpar eps; y = (z[[2]] + z[[3]])/2; s = 1 - kap (z[[1]] + z[[4]]); Nk = (1 - kap z[[1]])^2;\n  kap0 = -((z[[1]] - z[[2]]) (z[[1]] - z[[3]]))/((z[[4]] - z[[2]]) (z[[4]] - z[[3]])); nrm = lam[[1]]^2 ((z[[4]] - z[[2]]) (z[[4]] - z[[3]]))^2;\n  nu = th[[2]] - th[[4]]; ut = {1, -(z[[2]] + z[[3]]), z[[2]] z[[3]]}; u0 = th[[2]] + h;\n  l1 = nmLamK[1, th[[2]], th]; l2 = nmLamK[2, u0, th]; l3 = nmLamK[3, u0, th];\n  bra0W = nmProd4[{1, 0, 0, aa}, {-aa, 0, 0, 1}, {1, 0, 0, aa}, {-aa, 0, 0, 1}];\n  rows = Table[Module[{X1 = Fv[[1, n]], r4 = Fv[[2, n]], X2 = O23v[[1, n]], X3 = d3v[[1, n]], K, rho2, rho4, P, psi = PsiD[[All, n]]/Norm[PsiD[[All, n]]], ov0D, wDir, wClosed, realQ, nQ, nD, cdir, cclosed, cq, hn},\n    K = s^2 + kap s (X1/(h^2 l1) + X2/(2 h^4 y l2) + X3/(6 h^5 y^2 l3)) + kap^2 X3 X1/(24 h^7 y^2 l1 l3);\n    rho2 = X1/(h (th[[1]] - th[[2]]) (th[[2]] - th[[3]]) (nu - h)); rho4 = r4/(h (th[[1]] - th[[4]]) nu (th[[3]] - th[[4]]));\n    P = nmPab[nu, h][rho2, rho4]; ov0D = bra0D . psi; wDir = bra0W . psi; wClosed = ov0D (aa/kap0)^2 (ut . P . ut)/nrm;\n    realQ = Max[Abs[Im[psi/psi[[Ordering[Abs[psi], -1][[1]]]]]]] < 10^-30;\n    nQ = 1/invNQ[[n]]; nD = 1/invNdir[[n]];\n    hn = Abs[ov0D]^2/(Abs[nD] Conjugate[psi] . psi);\n    <|\"n\" -> n, \"real\" -> realQ, \"K\" -> K, \"Cdir\" -> Abs[K wDir/Nk], \"Cclosed\" -> Abs[K wClosed/Nk], \"CQ\" -> Abs[K (aa/kap0)^2 (ut . P . ut)/nrm/Nk] Sqrt[Abs[nQ]], \"invNerr\" -> Abs[invNQ[[n]]/invNdir[[n]] - 1], \"H\" -> hn, \"wErr\" -> Abs[wDir - wClosed]/Max[Abs[wDir], 10^-80], \"tauF\" -> {Fv[[1, n]], Fv[[2, n]]}|>], {n, 28}];\n  <|\"eps\" -> eps, \"rows\" -> rows, \"wchk\" -> wchk, \"gerr\" -> gerr, \"invNQ\" -> invNQ|>];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nmGT1 = AbsoluteTiming[{nmWA, nmYkA, nmGmA} = nmGram[nmOpsA];][[1]];\nnmRkA = {MatrixRank[Normal[nmWA], Modulus -> 2305843009213693951], MatrixRank[Normal[nmYkA], Modulus -> 2305843009213693951], MatrixRank[Normal[nmGmA], Modulus -> 2305843009213693951]};\nGrid[{{\"time words+Gram (s)\", nmGT1}, {\"rank (mod p) of regularised bra words, ket words, Gram\", nmRkA}, {\"# nonzero Gram entries\", nmNZ[nmGmA]}, {\"eps\", 1/100}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
