  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "Note: at finite eps the zero-weight sector contains many states with sizeable |C| that vanish as eps -> 0 (not singlets); the two singlets are identified by continuity in eps (nearest to the data values 1/sqrt(40) = 0.158114 and 1/sqrt(24) = 0.204124, E = 20 and E = 4 states). The relation 1/N_Q = 1/N_direct holds on all 28 states.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
