  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9. Phase: signed C_direct with the data phase\n\nThe data singlets (E = 20 and E = 4 HW states of `hw_L2.json`, real vectors) have C = -1/sqrt(40) and +1/sqrt(24). We fix the sign of the real unit eigenvector Psi_eps by <Psi_0^data|Psi_eps> > 0 and evaluate the signed C_direct = K <W_a|Psi_eps>/(1 - kappa z1)^2 (diagonal frame, eigenvalue data from the Lambda-twisted operators). The Q-based |C_Q| carries no sign: the sign is the sign of <0|Psi>, which is convention (phase of Psi), not Q-data.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nmHW = Import[\"C:\\\\Users\\\\pryan\\\\git-projects\\\\abjm-c123\\\\Paul\\\\Mathematica\\\\su4-alternating\\\\checks\\\\session-2026-10-13\\\\epsexp\\\\hw_L2.json\", \"RawJSON\"];\nnmPsi0 = {nmHW[\"psiRe\"][[5]], nmHW[\"psiRe\"][[6]]};\nnmSignCheck[eps_, prec_] := Module[{S = nmZeroStates[eps, prec], z, th, Lam, aa, kap, y, s, Nk, kap0, nrm, nu, u0, l1, l2, l3, h = nmH, T1, T4, T2u, T3u, bra0W, res, cpar = 3/10, sgn},\n  z = S[\"z\"]; th = S[\"th\"]; Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z];\n  aa = (nmPhi[[1]] - cpar)/(nmPhi[[1]] - nmPhi[[4]]); kap = 1 - cpar eps; y = (z[[2]] + z[[3]])/2; s = 1 - kap (z[[1]] + z[[4]]); Nk = (1 - kap z[[1]])^2;\n  u0 = th[[2]] + h; l1 = nmLamK[1, th[[2]], th]; l2 = nmLamK[2, u0, th]; l3 = nmLamK[3, u0, th];\n  T1 = nmT[1, Lam, th[[2]], th]; T4 = nmT[1, Lam, th[[4]], th]; T2u = nmT[2, Lam, u0, th]; T3u = nmTD[3, Lam, u0, th][[2]];\n  bra0W = nmProd4[{1, 0, 0, aa}, {-aa, 0, 0, 1}, {1, 0, 0, aa}, {-aa, 0, 0, 1}];\n  Table[Module[{best, tg = nmTgt[[j]]},\n    best = First[SortBy[Select[Range[28], Max[Abs[Im[S[\"R\"][[All, #]]/S[\"R\"][[Ordering[Abs[S[\"R\"][[All, #]]], -1][[1]], #]]]]] < 10^-30 &], Function[n, Module[{psi = ConstantArray[0, 256], X1, X2, X3, K, p},\n       psi[[nmZero]] = S[\"R\"][[All, n]]/Norm[S[\"R\"][[All, n]]]; p = Ordering[Abs[psi], -1][[1]];\n       X1 = (T1 . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]]; X2 = (T2u . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]]; X3 = (T3u . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]];\n       K = s^2 + kap s (X1/(h^2 l1) + X2/(2 h^4 y l2) + X3/(6 h^5 y^2 l3)) + kap^2 X3 X1/(24 h^7 y^2 l1 l3);\n       Abs[Abs[K (bra0W . psi)/Nk] - tg]]]]];\n    Module[{psi = ConstantArray[0, 256], X1, X2, X3, K, p, sg},\n      psi[[nmZero]] = S[\"R\"][[All, best]]/Norm[S[\"R\"][[All, best]]]; sg = Sign[Re[nmPsi0[[j]] . psi]]; psi = sg psi; p = Ordering[Abs[psi], -1][[1]];\n      X1 = (T1 . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]]; X2 = (T2u . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]]; X3 = (T3u . psi)[[p]]/psi[[p]];\n      K = s^2 + kap s (X1/(h^2 l1) + X2/(2 h^4 y l2) + X3/(6 h^5 y^2 l3)) + kap^2 X3 X1/(24 h^7 y^2 l1 l3);\n      {eps, j, best, N[nmPsi0[[j]] . psi, 8], N[K (bra0W . psi)/Nk, 12], N[tg, 12]}]], {j, 2}]];\nnmSgn = Table[nmSignCheck[e, 90], {e, {1/400, 1/800}}];\nGrid[Prepend[Flatten[nmSgn, 1], {\"eps\", \"singlet j (1: E=20, 2: E=4)\", \"state n\", \"<Psi0_data|Psi_eps> (sign-fixed > 0)\", \"signed C_direct\", \"|target| 1/sqrt40, 1/sqrt24 (data sign: -, +)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
