   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 10. Where does H - 1 come from? Pair-periodic theta\n\nThe slopes (H - 1)/eps of the two singlets extrapolate to 3.70 and 0.74 = (E/2) * 0.37 with E = 20, 4 the HW energies and 0.37 = theta_F2 - theta_F1 per eps. This suggests that H - 1 is controlled by the breaking of pair-periodicity of theta, not by the twist: for theta_F1 = theta_F2 the chain is invariant under the reflection-shift symmetry relating t^T (the reversed chain F A F A) to t, so PsiL is Psi^T U^{-T} for a fixed operator U. Test below: H on the 28 zero-weight states for (i) pair-periodic theta with a large generic-ish twist, (ii) pair-by-pair theta with theta_F2 - theta_F1 = delta, same twist.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nmZeroStatesTh[z_, th_, prec_] := Module[{Lam = DiagonalMatrix[z], comb, cb, vals, vecs, VR, VL},\n  comb = nmTbar[1, Lam, 3/11, th] + 7/10 nmPre[3, -5/7, th] nmTbar[3, Lam, -5/7, th] - 3/13 nmPre[2, 2/9, th] nmTbar[2, Lam, 2/9, th];\n  cb = N[Normal[comb[[nmZero, nmZero]]], prec]; {vals, vecs} = Eigensystem[cb]; VR = Transpose[vecs]; VL = Inverse[VR];\n  <|\"z\" -> z, \"th\" -> th, \"vals\" -> vals, \"R\" -> VR, \"L\" -> VL|>];\nnmHtab[z_, tf1_, tf2_] := Module[{th = {tf1 + 2 nmH, tf1, tf2 + 2 nmH, tf2}, S, r, rr},\n  S = nmZeroStatesTh[z, th, 60]; r = nmHtest[S]; rr = Select[r, #[[2]] &];\n  {Length[rr], N[Max[Abs[rr[[All, 3]] - 1]], 5], N[Min[rr[[All, 3]]], 5], N[Max[rr[[All, 3]]], 5]}];\nnmHrows = {{\"z = 1 + phi/10, theta_F = (0,0) periodic\", nmHtab[1 + nmPhi/10, 0, 0]}, {\"z = 1 + phi/10, theta_F = (1/7,1/7) periodic\", nmHtab[1 + nmPhi/10, 1/7, 1/7]}, {\"z = standard (3/2,5/4,2/3,4/7), theta_F = (1/7,1/7)\", nmHtab[nmZ0, 1/7, 1/7]}, {\"z = 1 + phi/10, theta_F = (0, 1/100)\", nmHtab[1 + nmPhi/10, 0, 1/100]}, {\"z = 1 + phi/10, theta_F = (0, 1/10)\", nmHtab[1 + nmPhi/10, 0, 1/10]}, {\"z = standard, theta_F = (0, 1/10)\", nmHtab[nmZ0, 0, 1/10]}};\nGrid[Prepend[nmHrows /. {a_String, {n_, m_, lo_, hi_}} :> {a, n, m, lo, hi}, {\"case\", \"# real states\", \"max |H - 1|\", \"min H\", \"max H\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
