      {
       "data": "Out[893]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{case} & \\text{\\# real states} & \\text{max |H - 1|} & \\text{min H} & \\text{max H}\\\\\\hline\\text{z = 1 + phi/10, theta\\_F = (0,0) periodic} & 16 & 0.0088103 & 0.99119 & 0.99983\\\\\\hline\\text{z = 1 + phi/10, theta\\_F = (1/7,1/7) periodic} & 16 & 0.0088103 & 0.99119 & 0.99983\\\\\\hline\\text{z = standard (3/2,5/4,2/3,4/7), theta\\_F = (1/7,1/7)} & 16 & 0.23620 & 0.76380 & 0.99309\\\\\\hline\\text{z = 1 + phi/10, theta\\_F = (0, 1/100)} & 16 & 0.099739 & 0.99150 & 1.0997\\\\\\hline\\text{z = 1 + phi/10, theta\\_F = (0, 1/10)} & 16 & 1.7413 & 0.99267 & 2.7413\\\\\\hline\\text{z = standard, theta\\_F = (0, 1/10)} & 16 & 1.4049 & 0.86073 & 2.4049\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "7932b680-f1ab-483a-831f-13f7e6d0fb48"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (section 10).** H is not exactly 1 even at pair-periodic theta with finite twist (max |H - 1| = 0.0088 at eps = 0.1, i.e. O(eps^2)), and it grows linearly with the pair-periodicity breaking theta_F2 - theta_F1 (max H = 1.0997 for delta = 1/100 at the same twist, slope E/2 = 10 for the E = 20 state). So there is no exact finite-twist identity between the Euclidean norm and the SoV pairing; H = 1 + (E/2)(theta_F2 - theta_F1) + O(eps^2) on the singlets.\n\n## 11. The L = 2 even bridge in the 2603 form: factor table\n\nC = N_pre . A . W / sqrt(B) with A = P_kappa(tau) = K_kappa, W = u~ . P(rho2, rho4) . u~ (F-site single-Q ratios), B = sum tauT_y M_yx tau_x (SoV norm), N_pre = (a/kappa0)^n (lambda1 u4)^{-L} / (1 - kappa z1)^2 (n = 2, L = 2; explicit theta, z).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "nmFactors[res_, row_] := Module[{eps = res[\"eps\"], z, th, nu, h = nmH, aa, kap, kap0, lam, nrm, Nk, rho2, rho4, P, ut, W, pre, B},\n  z = 1 + eps nmPhi; th = nmThEps[eps]; nu = th[[2]] - th[[4]]; lam = nmLamW[z];\n  aa = (nmPhi[[1]] - 3/10)/(nmPhi[[1]] - nmPhi[[4]]); kap = 1 - 3/10 eps; kap0 = -((z[[1]] - z[[2]]) (z[[1]] - z[[3]]))/((z[[4]] - z[[2]]) (z[[4]] - z[[3]]));\n  nrm = lam[[1]]^2 ((z[[4]] - z[[2]]) (z[[4]] - z[[3]]))^2; Nk = (1 - kap z[[1]])^2; ut = {1, -(z[[2]] + z[[3]]), z[[2]] z[[3]]};\n  rho2 = row[\"tauF\"][[1]]/(h (th[[1]] - th[[2]]) (th[[2]] - th[[3]]) (nu - h)); rho4 = row[\"tauF\"][[2]]/(h (th[[1]] - th[[4]]) nu (th[[3]] - th[[4]]));\n  P = nmPab[nu, h][rho2, rho4]; W = ut . P . ut; pre = (aa/kap0)^2/nrm/Nk; B = res[\"invNQ\"][[row[\"n\"]]];\n  {Abs[row[\"K\"]], pre, Abs[W], Abs[B], Abs[row[\"K\"]] pre Abs[W]/Sqrt[Abs[B]], row[\"CQ\"]}];\nnmFacTab = Table[Table[Prepend[N[nmFactors[nmResList[[i]], nmSing[[j, i]]], 10], nmEpsL[[i]]], {i, 6}], {j, 2}];\nColumn[Table[Grid[Prepend[nmFacTab[[j]], {\"eps\", \"|A| = |K_kappa|\", \"N_pre\", \"|W|\", \"|B| = |sum tauT M tau|\", \"|N_pre A W|/sqrt|B|\", \"|C_Q| (assembled)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left], {j, 2}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
